The Governor Manager no longer crashes when it quits on SIGTERM (at logout, or with the tray icon when the session ends): RoundedToolTip.install removes its event filter when the app quits (aboutToQuit). The filter saw the events of widgets destroyed after the event loop had ended, while Python was tearing down, and the process ended with a segmentation fault every time; core's tooltip has the same fix. Tests: tests/test_widgets.py.

